   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Reflect on the stage of autonomy versus doubt, which occurs during toddlerhood according to Erikson. Were there moments in your early life where you felt encouraged to explore and be independent, or were there times when you felt doubt or shame in trying new things? How have these early experiences shaped your confidence in making decisions and taking on challenges today?",
